# Urbit Mail Client

%mail-client lets you send and receive email on your Urbit ship.

- Ship-to-ship mail via Ames (direct, no gateway needed)
- External email via a trusted gateway ship
- Email aliases (free, paid with ETH, invite-based)
- Labels with dot-notation in email addresses
- Automatic mail forwarding between ships
- Batch operations (select multiple, mark read/delete)
- Backup and restore mail data as JSON
- Web Push notifications (iOS PWA + desktop)
- PWA installable app with offline icon
- Dark/light theme with system preference detection

## Getting started

After installing %mail-client, open the web UI:

```
https://your-ship/mail
```

Or use CLI generators in dojo:

```
+mail-client!mail/inbox
+mail-client!mail/sent
+mail-client!mail/unread
```

